[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) is marked known, with one fix queued. Its reports hold more than one
problem. The desk merged them because their subject lines matched
([decision 0001](/kb/decisions/0001-dedupe-by-subject)), and a subject line says what the customer
saw, which can come from different bugs. This page splits #4471 by what caused each report and
links each problem to its own ticket.

<Callout kind="warn">
